007-xuzhaopei-f-方諸-mother","subject_person_id":"rvc_bqx_v5w_C","object_person_id":"9ji_nha_sct","predicate":"mother","qualifiers":{"source_term":"母王夫人","liang007_xuzhaopei_reading":"f-方諸-mother"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-liangshu","book_id":"b-liangshu-044","source_id":"s-liangshu-044-xuzhaopei-children-ws2376749","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-044-xuzhaopei-children","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-044-xuzhaopei-children:p004","quote":"貞惠世子方諸，字智相，世祖第二子。母王夫人。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-liangshu-044-xuzhaopei-children:p004:m0004","object_person_mention_id":"c-liangshu-044-xuzhaopei-children:p004:m0018","relationship_anchor":{"paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-044-xuzhaopei-children:p004","surface":"母王夫人","start":17,"end":21}}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"本傳首明所生母。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null},{"id":"a-liang007-xuzhaopei-f-方諸-mother-sequence","subject_person_id":"rvc_bqx_v5w_C","object_person_id":"9ji_nha_sct","predicate":"mother","qualifiers":{"source_term":"生貞惠世子","liang007_xuzhaopei_reading":"f-方諸-mother-sequence"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-liangshu","book_id":"b-liangshu-044","source_id":"s-liangshu-044-xuzhaopei-children-ws2376749","chapter_id":"c-liangshu-044-xuzhaopei-children","paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-044-xuzhaopei-children:p001","quote":"世祖諸男：徐妃生忠壯世子方等，王夫人生貞惠世子方諸","subject_person_mention_id":"c-liangshu-044-xuzhaopei-children:p001:m0023","object_person_mention_id":"c-liangshu-044-xuzhaopei-children:p001:m0015","relationship_anchor":{"paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-044-xuzhaopei-children:p001","surface":"生貞惠世子","start":18,"end":23}}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"世祖諸男母序。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null},{"id":"a-liang007-xuzhaopei-n-wang-mother","subject_person_id":"rvc_bqx_v5w_C","object_person_id":"9ji_nha_sct","predicate":"mother","qualifiers":{"source_term":"方諸母王氏","liang007_xuzhaopei_reading":"n-wang-mother"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-012","source_id":"s-nanshi-012-xuzhaopei-ws2060595","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-012-xuzhaopei","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-012-xuzhaopei:p001","quote":"元帝徐妃諱昭佩，東海郯人也。祖孝嗣，齊太尉、枝江文忠公。父緄，侍中、信武將軍。妃以天監十六年十二月拜湘東王妃，生世子方等、益昌公主含貞。妃無容質，不見禮，帝三二年一入房。妃以帝眇一目，每知帝將至，必為半面妝以俟，帝見則大怒而出。妃性嗜酒，多洪醉，帝還房，必吐衣中。與荊州後堂瑤光寺智遠道人私通。酷妒忌，見無寵之妾，便交杯接坐。才覺有娠者，即手加刀刃。帝左右暨季江有姿容，又與淫通。季江每歎曰：「柏直狗雖老猶能獵，蕭溧陽馬雖老猶駿，徐娘雖老猶尚多情。」時有賀徽者美色，妃要之於普賢尼寺，書白角枕為詩相贈答。既而貞惠世子方諸母王氏寵愛，未幾而終，元帝歸咎於妃；及方等死，愈見疾。太清三年，遂逼令自殺。妃知不免，乃透井死。帝以屍還徐氏，謂之出妻。葬江陵瓦官寺。帝制金樓子述其淫行。初，妃嫁夕，車至西州，而疾風大起，髮屋折木。無何，雪霰交下，帷簾皆白。及長還之日，又大雷震西州聽事兩柱俱碎。帝以為不祥，后果不終婦道。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-012-xuzhaopei:p001:m0258","object_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-012-xuzhaopei:p001:m0261","relationship_anchor":{"paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-012-xuzhaopei:p001","surface":"方諸母王氏","start":258,"end":263}}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"方諸之母王氏。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"life_events":[{"id":"le-liang007-xuzhaopei-wang-death","person_id":"9ji_nha_sct","event_type":"death","source_term":"終","source_anchor":{"paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-012-xuzhaopei:p001","surface":"終","start":269,"end":270},"date_expression":null,"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-012","source_id":"s-nanshi-012-xuzhaopei-ws2060595","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-012-xuzhaopei","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-012-xuzhaopei:p001","quote":"元帝徐妃諱昭佩，東海郯人也。祖孝嗣，齊太尉、枝江文忠公。父緄，侍中、信武將軍。妃以天監十六年十二月拜湘東王妃，生世子方等、益昌公主含貞。妃無容質，不見禮，帝三二年一入房。妃以帝眇一目，每知帝將至，必為半面妝以俟，帝見則大怒而出。妃性嗜酒，多洪醉，帝還房，必吐衣中。與荊州後堂瑤光寺智遠道人私通。酷妒忌，見無寵之妾，便交杯接坐。才覺有娠者，即手加刀刃。帝左右暨季江有姿容，又與淫通。季江每歎曰：「柏直狗雖老猶能獵，蕭溧陽馬雖老猶駿，徐娘雖老猶尚多情。」時有賀徽者美色，妃要之於普賢尼寺，書白角枕為詩相贈答。既而貞惠世子方諸母王氏寵愛，未幾而終，元帝歸咎於妃；及方等死，愈見疾。太清三年，遂逼令自殺。妃知不免，乃透井死。帝以屍還徐氏，謂之出妻。葬江陵瓦官寺。帝制金樓子述其淫行。初，妃嫁夕，車至西州，而疾風大起，髮屋折木。無何，雪霰交下，帷簾皆白。及長還之日，又大雷震西州聽事兩柱俱碎。帝以為不祥，后果不終婦道。","person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-012-xuzhaopei:p001:m0261"}],"status":"